PDB- and CCD-derived structural data
------------------------------------

Structural data derived from the Protein Data Bank archive and RCSB PDB APIs
remain subject to the wwPDB/RCSB PDB usage policy. PDB archive data are made
available under the CC0 1.0 Universal Public Domain Dedication. Users are
encouraged to attribute the original structure authors and the RCSB PDB.

https://www.rcsb.org/pages/usage-policy
https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

